# One loyalty ability per planeswalker each turn (CR 606.3): after the +1 on turn 1 (loyalty 5) the -3 is refused in the
# same turn. On turn 3 the -3 is taken (the positive control, loyalty 2, with no target: "up to one", an empty Target) and still
# draws; on turn 5 another -3 is refused because its loyalty cost cannot be paid (2 < 3).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Teferi, Time Raveler
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Teferi, Time Raveler.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Teferi, Time Raveler.Activate(Ability: +1)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Teferi, Time Raveler.Counters.Loyalty = 5
! Bot1.Battlefield.Teferi, Time Raveler.Activate(Ability: Return up to one)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Teferi, Time Raveler.Activate(Ability: Return up to one)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Teferi, Time Raveler.Counters.Loyalty = 2
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Battlefield.Teferi, Time Raveler.Activate(Ability: Return up to one)

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
